<title>NEW ZEALAND: Fletcher CEO earns over NZ$1 million.</title>
<headline>Fletcher CEO earns over NZ$1 million.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fletcher Challenge Ltd chief executive Hugh Fletcher earned NZ$1,086,394 in the 1995/96 year, the company's annual report published on Wednesday revealed.</p>
<p>He earned $723,966 in salary and $362,428 in incentives. He received motor vehicle and miscellaneous benefits of $71,000 as well.</p>
<p>Chief Financial Office Ian Donald earned $768,419 and Fletcher Challenge Energy chief executive Michael Andrews earned $687,828.</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom 64 4 4734 746</p>
